# The Villagers site, peoplesweb.org/villagers, on each push to EShapiro2/Villagers (Udi, 2026-11-25).  Each minute it runs peoplesweb-villagers.service, which builds the site only if the repository has moved.  Installed and enabled by deploy/sweep.sh.
[Unit]
Description=peoplesweb.org/villagers on each push to EShapiro2/Villagers

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:*:45
AccuracySec=5s

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
